# 四象限滤纸片抑菌圈实验（AsterML v2）

> 说明：本设计采用通用科学模块自由组合而成；四象限培养皿示意图仅用于步骤可视化辅助表达，所有分组名称、药物浓度与抑菌圈测量读数均存储于结构化模块中。

```asterlab
kind: experiment
id: exp-iz
schema: 1
title: HAMA / 万古霉素 / 溶菌酶 四象限抑菌圈实验
objective: 在金黄色葡萄球菌涂布平板上比较 HAMA 水凝胶、万古霉素（Van）与溶菌酶的抑菌圈直径（mm）。
experimental_unit: 90 mm 琼脂培养皿分区（四象限）
primary_endpoint: 抑菌圈平均直径
endpoint_method: 交叉十字双径卡尺测量 (d1 + d2) / 2
endpoint_unit: mm
```

```asterlab
kind: group_table
id: gt-iz
schema: 1
title: 四象限给药分组
rows:
  - id: g-blank
    name: Q1 空白对照 (PBS)
    role: control
    dose: 20 uL
    condition: 无菌 PBS 浸泡滤纸片
    replicate_count: 3
  - id: g-hama
    name: Q2 HAMA 水凝胶组
    role: treatment
    dose: 5 % w/v
    condition: 5% HAMA 光交联样片 (6 mm)
    replicate_count: 3
  - id: g-van
    name: Q3 万古霉素阳性对照
    role: reference
    dose: 30 ug/mL
    condition: Van 药敏滤纸片
    replicate_count: 3
  - id: g-lys
    name: Q4 溶菌酶处理组
    role: treatment
    dose: 10 mg/mL
    condition: 溶菌酶溶液浸渍滤纸片
    replicate_count: 3
```

```asterlab
kind: assay
id: assay-iz
schema: 1
title: 琼脂扩散抑菌圈测定
endpoint: inhibition_zone_mm
unit: mm
group_refs: [g-blank, g-hama, g-van, g-lys]
timepoints: [16h]
```

```asterlab
kind: plate
id: dish-iz
schema: 1
format: 6
topology: dish
rows: 2
columns: 2
assay: assay-iz
groups:
  g-blank: [A1]
  g-hama: [A2]
  g-van: [B1]
  g-lys: [B2]
roles:
  A1: blank
  A2: sample
  B1: positive_control
  B2: sample
samples:
  A1: Q1-PBS
  A2: Q2-HAMA
  B1: Q3-Van
  B2: Q4-Lys
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-01-lawn
schema: 1
execution: executable
title: 01 菌悬液校正与 LB 琼脂均匀涂布
assay: assay-iz
timepoints: [16h]
path: iz/01-lawn
order: 1
blocks:
  - kind: prose
    id: blk-iz-lawn-note
    schema: 1
    title: 涂布控制要点
    tone: tip
    body: 菌液 OD600 稀释至 0.5 AU（约 1×10^8 CFU/mL），吸取 100 uL 用无菌涂布棒旋转三方向均匀涂布。
  - kind: param_table
    id: blk-iz-lawn-params
    schema: 1
    title: 菌液与培养基参数
    rows:
      - key: od600
        label: 菌液起始 OD600
        value: 0.5
        unit: AU
      - key: inoculum_vol
        label: 单皿涂布菌液体积
        value: 100
        unit: uL
      - key: agar_temp
        label: 倒板琼脂温度
        value: 45
        unit: Cel
      - key: agar_vol
        label: 单皿琼脂铺板量
        value: 20
        unit: mL
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-02-quadrants
schema: 1
execution: executable
title: 02 四象限贴片布局与处理分组
assay: assay-iz
timepoints: [16h]
path: iz/02-quadrants
order: 2
blocks:
  - kind: param_table
    id: blk-iz-disc-params
    schema: 1
    title: 滤纸片与加样规格
    rows:
      - key: disc_diameter
        label: 滤纸片直径
        value: 6
        unit: mm
      - key: load_volume
        label: 单片载药体积
        value: 20
        unit: uL
  - kind: figure
    id: blk-iz-quadrant-svg
    schema: 1
    title: 四象限培养皿布片示意图
    caption: 示意：90 mm 琼脂皿四象限分区（辅助空间参照，分组数值以结构化分组表为准）
    max_height: 240
    svg: |
      <svg viewBox="0 0 420 264" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <circle cx="210" cy="130" r="92" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"/>
        <circle cx="210" cy="130" r="86" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.8" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/>
        <line x1="118" y1="130" x2="302" y2="130" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="6 4"/>
        <line x1="210" y1="38" x2="210" y2="222" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="6 4"/>
        <circle cx="170" cy="96" r="9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/>
        <circle cx="250" cy="96" r="21" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/>
        <circle cx="250" cy="96" r="9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/>
        <circle cx="170" cy="166" r="29" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/>
        <circle cx="170" cy="166" r="9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.0"/>
        <circle cx="250" cy="166" r="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/>
        <circle cx="250" cy="166" r="9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/>
        <text x="108" y="66" font-size="11" text-anchor="end">Q1 空白 PBS</text>
        <text x="312" y="66" font-size="11" text-anchor="start">Q2 HAMA</text>
        <text x="108" y="200" font-size="11" text-anchor="end">Q3 万古霉素 (+)</text>
        <text x="312" y="200" font-size="11" text-anchor="start">Q4 溶菌酶</text>
      </svg>
    annotations:
      - label: 90 mm Agar Dish
        x: 210
        y: 250
  - kind: checklist
    id: blk-iz-disc-chk
    schema: 1
    title: 贴片操作核查
    items:
      - id: chk-dry
        label: 平板表面菌液已吸收 10 min 无浮液
        blocking: true
      - id: chk-press
        label: 镊子轻压药敏片使其与琼脂紧密接触，片距 > 24 mm
        blocking: true
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-03-incubate
schema: 1
execution: executable
title: 03 恒温倒置培养与皿底拍照归档
assay: assay-iz
timepoints: [16h]
path: iz/03-incubate
order: 3
blocks:
  - kind: timer
    id: blk-iz-timer
    schema: 1
    title: 37 Cel 恒温倒置培养计时
    mode: countdown
    duration: {value: 16, unit: h}
    anchor: inoculum_done
  - kind: attachment
    id: blk-iz-photo
    schema: 1
    title: 培养皿实物拍摄归档
    scope: step_evidence
    slots_per_cell: 1
    note: 皿底垫黑色无反光背景，标尺与皿缘同平面垂直拍摄。
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-04-measure
schema: 1
execution: executable
title: 04 十字双径游标卡尺测量与均值计算
assay: assay-iz
timepoints: [16h]
path: iz/04-measure
order: 4
blocks:
  - kind: data_table
    id: blk-iz-table
    schema: 1
    title: 四象限抑菌圈测量记录
    schema_id: inhibition_zone_mm
    endpoint: zone_diameter
    columns:
      - key: sample
        label: 象限样本
        value_kind: text
      - key: d1
        label: 水平径 d1
        value_kind: number
        unit: mm
        min: 6
        max: 45
      - key: d2
        label: 垂直径 d2
        value_kind: number
        unit: mm
        min: 6
        max: 45
      - key: mean_d
        label: 平均抑菌直径
        value_kind: formula
        formula: "(d1 + d2) / 2"
        unit: mm
    rows:
      - sample: Q1-PBS
        d1: 6.0
        d2: 6.0
      - sample: Q2-HAMA
        d1: 11.4
        d2: 11.8
      - sample: Q3-Van
        d1: 21.2
        d2: 20.8
      - sample: Q4-Lys
        d1: 14.5
        d2: 14.1
```

```asterlab
kind: workflow
id: wf-iz
schema: 1
steps: [step-01-lawn, step-02-quadrants, step-03-incubate, step-04-measure]
edges:
  - from: step-01-lawn
    to: step-02-quadrants
  - from: step-02-quadrants
    to: step-03-incubate
  - from: step-03-incubate
    to: step-04-measure
```
